  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"573\" height=\"149\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Venthyr</strong> 家具套裝為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fantasy's Furniture</strong></a> 所設計，新增了完全可互動的家具，包含但不限於：<strong>箱子</strong>、<strong>抽屜</strong>、<strong>床鋪</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong>等更多內容！</p>\n<p>此家具套裝的設計靈感主要來自《<strong>魔獸世界</strong>》的 <strong>暗影國度</strong> 擴充包中的 <strong>Venthyr（萬靈盟約）</strong>。</p>\n<h3>合成配方</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>若要合成 <strong>Venthyr 木板</strong>／<strong>Venthyr 羊毛</strong>，必須放入 <strong>#minecraft:planks</strong>／<strong>#minecraft:wool</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/stonecutter_planks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/stonecutter_wool.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>若要製作 <strong>Venthyr</strong> 家具方塊，必須將 <strong>#fantasyfurniture:binding_agent</strong>、<strong>Venthyr 木板</strong> 與 <strong>Venthyr 羊毛</strong> 放入 <strong>家具製作台</strong> 中。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 <strong>Discord</strong> 社群</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
